    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Magic action, you can expend 1 Focus Point to touch a creature and restore a number of Hit Points equal to a roll of your Martial Arts die plus your Wisdom modifier.</p><p>When you use your Flurry of Blows, you can replace one of the Unarmed Strikes with a use of this feature without expending a Focus Point for the healing.</p><section id=\"secret-LN6wqVwidwz8lQxo\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>For the free use when replacing an Unarmed Strike uncheck the Consume Item Use prompt.</p></section>",
